{"v":1,"src":"wd","city":"vatican-city","factsAt":"2026-10-27T16:48:50.768Z","places":[{"i":"wd/Q12512","q":"Q12512","n":"St. Peter's Basilica","e":"St. Peter's Basilica","a":"كاتدرائية القديس بطرس","g":"religion","y":41.90222,"x":12.45342,"sl":131,"vis":11000000,"web":"https://www.basilicasanpietro.va/","d":"كاتدرائية القديس بطرس هي أكبر كنيسة في العالم وأحد أهم رموز الفن المعماري النهضوي والباروكي، وتضم أعمالا فنية فريدة.","de":"St. Peter's Basilica is the largest church in the world and a masterpiece of Renaissance and Baroque architecture, housing unique artworks.","m":120,"bt":"الصباح الباكر لتجنب الطوابير الطويلة","bte":"Early morning to avoid long queues","tp":"اصعد إلى القمة عبر المصعد ثم الدرج للحصول على أفضل إطلالة بانورامية على روما","tpe":"Take the elevator then stairs to the dome top for the best panoramic view of Rome","dr":"يجب ارتداء ملابس محتشمة تغطي الكتفين والرقعتين","dre":"Modest dress covering shoulders and knees is required","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"church","im":"f/f5/Basilica_di_San_Pietro_in_Vaticano_September_2015-1a.jpg","ia":"Alvesgaspar","il":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"i":"wd/Q2943","q":"Q2943","n":"Sistine Chapel","e":"Sistine Chapel","a":"كنيسة سيستينا","g":"religion","y":41.90296,"x":12.45443,"sl":90,"web":"https://www.museivaticani.va/content/museivaticani/fr.html","d":"كنيسة السيستين تشتهر بلوحات جدارية وسقف تاريخي رسمه مايكل أنجلو، وتعد تحفة فنية لا تُعوض في الفن العالمي.","de":"The Sistine Chapel is renowned for its frescoed ceiling and walls painted by Michelangelo, standing as a priceless masterpiece of art.","m":45,"bt":"فور فتح المتاحف صباحا","bte":"Right when the museums open in the morning","tp":"التصوير ممنوع منعا باتا داخل الكنيسة، ويُطلب التزام الصمت","tpe":"Photography is strictly prohibited inside the chapel and silence is required","dr":"ملابس محتشمة للجميع","dre":"Modest clothing for everyone","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"church"},{"i":"wd/Q182955","q":"Q182955","n":"Vatican Museums","e":"Vatican Museums","a":"متاحف الفاتيكان","g":"museums","y":41.90639,"x":12.45444,"sl":65,"vis":1612530,"web":"http://www.museivaticani.va","d":"متاحف الفاتيكان تضم واحدة من أعظم مجموعات الفن في العالم والتي جمعها البابوات على مر القرون، بما في ذلك المنحوتات الكلاسيكية.","de":"The Vatican Museums house one of the greatest art collections in the world accumulated by Popes over centuries, including classical sculptures.","m":180,"bt":"الحجز المسبق أول ساعات الصباح","bte":"Booked in advance, early morning hours","tp":"استخدم المسار المختصر المؤدي مباشرة إلى كنيسة السيستين إذا كنت بحاجة لتوفير الوقت","tpe":"Use the shortcut leading directly to the Sistine Chapel if you are short on time","dr":"احرص على ارتداء ملابس محتشمة","dre":"Ensure you wear modest clothing","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"gallery","im":"0/0e/Mura_vaticane_-_ingresso_ai_Musei_00410.JPG","ia":"user:Lalupa","il":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"i":"wd/Q213678","q":"Q213678","n":"Vatican Library","e":"Vatican Library","a":"مكتبة الفاتيكان","g":"culture","y":41.90472,"x":12.45444,"sl":72,"web":"https://www.vaticanlibrary.va","d":"مكتبة الفاتيكان تضم واحدة من أقدم مجموعات النصوص التاريخية والمخطوطات النادرة في العالم.","de":"The Vatican Library contains one of the oldest collections of historical texts and rare manuscripts in the world.","m":60,"bt":"أيام العمل الرسمية","bte":"Working weekdays","tp":"الدخول عادة مخصص للباحثين والدارسين ويتطلب تصاريح مسبقة","tpe":"Access is usually restricted to researchers and scholars requiring prior permits","kids":false,"out":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"culture","im":"5/56/Melozzo_da_Forlì_001.jpg","ia":"Melozzo da Forlì","il":"Public domain"},{"i":"wd/Q83425","q":"Q83425","n":"Saint Peter's Square","e":"Saint Peter's Square","a":"ميدان القديس بطرس","g":"history","y":41.90218,"x":12.45724,"sl":66,"d":"ساحة القديس بطرس هي ساحة بيضاوية ضخمة تقع أمام كاتدرائية القديس بطرس وتحيط بها أعمدة بيرنيني المهيبة.","de":"Saint Peter's Square is a massive elliptical plaza situated directly in front of St. Peter's Basilica, embraced by Bernini's majestic colonnades.","m":45,"bt":"المساء مع إضاءة المعالم","bte":"Evening with monument illuminations","tp":"قف على حجرين محددين في الساحة للحصول على منظور بصري فريد حيث تصطف الأعمدة كعمود واحد","tpe":"Stand on the designated stone markers in the square to see the colonnade columns align into one","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"square","im":"d/d6/St_Peter's_Square,_Vatican_City_-_April_2007.jpg","ia":"Diliff","il":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"i":"wd/Q145093","q":"Q145093","n":"Apostolic Palace","e":"Apostolic Palace","a":"القصر الرسولي","g":"history","y":41.90361,"x":12.45639,"sl":60,"d":"القصر الرسولي هو المقر الرسمي للبابا في الفاتيكان، ويضم غرف رافاييل وكنيسة سيستين الشهيرة بلوحاتها الفنية الخالدة.","de":"The Apostolic Palace is the official residence of the Pope in Vatican City, housing the famous Raphael Rooms and the Sistine Chapel with its timeless masterpieces.","m":180,"bt":"الصباح الباكر لتجنب الازدحام الشديد","bte":"Early morning to avoid heavy crowds","tp":"احجز التذاكر عبر الإنترنت قبل موعد الزيارة بأسابيع طويلة","tpe":"Book tickets online weeks in advance","dr":"يجب تغطية الكتفين والركبتين للرجال والنساء","dre":"Shoulders and knees must be covered for all visitors","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"palace","im":"4/47/2018-03-18_Apostolischer_Palast.jpg","ia":"Burkhard Mücke","il":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"i":"wd/Q235242","q":"Q235242","n":"Pietà","e":"Pietà","a":"تمثال بيتتا","g":"history","y":41.90222,"x":12.45333,"sl":57,"d":"تمثال البييتا للفنان مايكل أنجلو تحفة فنية رخامية فريدة تجسد السيدة العذراء وهي تحضن السيد المسيح، ويقع داخل كاتدرائية القديس بطرس.","de":"Michelangelo's Pietà is a masterpiece of Renaissance sculpture depicting the Virgin Mary cradling Jesus, located inside St. Peter's Basilica.","m":30,"bt":"أول الصباح عند فتح الكاتدرائية","bte":"First thing in the morning when the basilica opens","tp":"استعد لوجود زحام مستمر حول الحاجز الزجاجي للتمثال","tpe":"Be prepared for crowds viewing the statue behind a protective glass barrier","dr":"يجب ارتداء ملابس محتشمة تغطي الكتفين والركبتين","dre":"Modest dress covering shoulders and knees is required","kids":true,"wAt":"2026-10-21","kd":"landmark","im":"5/5b/The_Pietà_by_Michelangelo_(48135182552).jpg","ia":"Michelangelo","il":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"i":"wd/Q42003","q":"Q42003","n":"Gardens of Vatican City","e":"Gardens of Vatican City","a":"حدائق الفاتيكان","g":"nature","y":41.90306,"x":12.45056,"sl":32,"web":"http://www.vaticanstate.va/content/vaticanstate/en/monumenti/giardini-vaticani.html","kd":"garden","im":"2/23/Vatikanische_Gaerten_Museen_Rom.jpg","ia":"Stefan Bauer, http://www.ferras.at","il":"CC BY-SA 2.5"},{"i":"wd/Q810126","q":"Q810126","n":"Old St. Peter's Basilica","e":"Old St. Peter's Basilica","g":"religion","y":41.90222,"x":12.45333,"sl":30,"kd":"church","im":"f/f4/Vatican_-_basilique_-_Vue_d’ensemble_de_l'antique_basilique_vaticane_basilica.jpg","ia":"Debole","il":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"i":"wd/Q249973","q":"Q249973","n":"Niccoline Chapel","e":"Niccoline Chapel","a":"المصلى النيكوليني","g":"religion","y":41.9034,"x":12.45462,"sl":18,"kd":"church","im":"9/9a/St._Peter_Niccoline_Chapel.jpg","ia":"Fra Angelico","il":"Public domain"},{"i":"wd/Q1717939","q":"Q1717939","n":"Vatican Grotto","e":"Vatican Grotto","g":"history","y":41.90222,"x":12.45333,"sl":18,"kd":"ancient","im":"f/fb/Pianta_delle_Grotte_Vaticane.jpg","ia":"Carlo Fontana","il":"Public domain"},{"i":"wd/Q4540172","q":"Q4540172","n":"Mater Ecclesiae Monastery","e":"Mater Ecclesiae Monastery","g":"religion","y":41.90375,"x":12.45108,"sl":18,"kd":"church","im":"6/69/Giardini_vaticani,_monastero_di_mater_ecclesiae_2.jpg","ia":"Sailko","il":"CC BY 3.0"},{"i":"wd/Q2158200","q":"Q2158200","n":"Saint Peter's tomb","e":"Saint Peter's tomb","a":"قبر القديس بطرس","g":"history","y":41.9022,"x":12.4533,"sl":18,"kd":"ancient","im":"5/53/Rom,_Vatikan,_Petrusgrab_unterhalb_des_Papstaltars_des_Petersdoms_in_den_Vatikanischen_Grotten.jpg","ia":"Dnalor 01","il":"CC BY-SA 3.0 at"},{"i":